(Penny:)Anyway, to this day, I still can't see a box
of crayons without crossing my legs. Ha, ha.

4
00:00:13,158 --> 00:00:14,648
(Bernadette:)I don't have to take this.

5
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:17,730
(Bernadette:)I'm gonna go home
and have sex with my husband right now.

6
00:00:17,929 --> 00:00:21,159
(Bernadette:)Maybe I'll let him do it to me
in the parking spot.

7
00:00:22,701 --> 00:00:26,401
(Bernadette:)Which sounds dirty
but I didn't mean it that way.

8
00:00:29,341 --> 00:00:31,101
Okay, here's another one.

9
00:00:31,343 --> 00:00:34,713
If a zombie bites a vampire...

10
00:00:34,913 --> 00:00:36,573
...and the vampire bites a human...

11
00:00:36,815 --> 00:00:40,685
...does the human become a vampire
or a zombie?

12
00:00:41,419 --> 00:00:43,579
Or a zompire?

13
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:47,350
(Leonard:)Sheldon?

14
00:00:47,559 --> 00:00:49,359
Cookie?

15
00:00:50,729 --> 00:00:53,219
- I don't have any.
- Well, I'm not giving it away.

16
